{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>ושתי.</b> A term of drinking. The tav has a dagesh because it comes in place of two [letters] — for there is no שִׁיתָה without a tav, and one [tav] is for the root and one for service." "<b>Unto the river.</b> The Euphrates." "<b>וגרשתמו.</b> וּתְגָרְשֵׁם — and you shall drive them out."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:13.628576072Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}